Backtraces name functions on Radix (ADR 0070): the backtrace crate in
std maps the program's file and reads its symbols with gimli, and finds
the program through dl_iterate_phdr and std::env::current_exe, as on the
Hurd, since Radix has no /proc/self/maps.

